00:20:54.519 --> 00:20:56.698
When you have realized the truth,

00:20:56.722 --> 00:20:58.486
the curse will be no longer.

00:21:02.794 --> 00:21:04.539
So, that was what this was about.

00:21:04.563 --> 00:21:07.342
The number of people I defeated
had nothing to do with it.

00:21:07.366 --> 00:21:10.427
The curse was lifted when I found
the True Way of the Fist.

00:21:11.270 --> 00:21:13.448
The True Way of the Fist.

00:21:13.472 --> 00:21:14.949
This...

00:21:14.973 --> 00:21:17.442
Master, Junpei...

00:21:18.176 --> 00:21:20.941
Thank you. Thank you.

00:21:23.181 --> 00:21:24.058
Hey!

00:21:24.082 --> 00:21:24.659
What is it, Junpei?
Hey!

00:21:24.683 --> 00:21:25.960
What is it, Junpei?

00:21:25.984 --> 00:21:28.763
| forgot to take off her clothes!

00:21:28.787 --> 00:21:30.398
You are a true...

00:21:30.422 --> 00:21:32.584
A true numbskull!

00:21:54.479 --> 00:22:01.562
Yaru ki ga nai hi wa yasunda mo ii yo

00:22:01.586 --> 00:22:08.569
Jinsei wa nagakutte kimagure da kara

00:22:08.593 --> 00:22:15.677
Watashi wa anata o hyakubai ni dekiru

00:22:15.701 --> 00:22:18.913
Sore ja mou nechaimashou

00:22:18.937 --> 00:22:22.817
Sotto daitete ne

00:22:22.841 --> 00:22:27.802
Kyouryuu ni atta te

00:22:29.915 --> 00:22:36.631
Wa haha to warau, sonna hito

00:22:36.655 --> 00:22:43.338
Hana mo arashi mo hora
fumikoenagara

00:22:43.362 --> 00:22:50.945
Jidai ga kawatte iku kenai ga kikoeru

00:22:50.969 --> 00:22:57.652
Sui mo amai mo baby, kamiwakenagara

00:22:57.676 --> 00:23:05.676
Kujikenaide ne tensai wa
saigo ni kuru no

00:23:12.591 --> 00:23:15.036
I've set off the fire alarm at my school.

00:23:15.060 --> 00:23:18.373
I've taken apart the human anatomy
model in the science room.

00:23:18.397 --> 00:23:21.175
I've broken the window
in the music room.

00:23:21.199 --> 00:23:24.278
And let me see now...

00:23:24.302 --> 00:23:26.481
I'm really sorry!

00:23:26.505 --> 00:23:29.917
The next episode is about stuffed
animals, the tank, gasoline and me.

00:23:29.941 --> 00:23:31.252
Gee, that makes sense.

00:23:31.276 --> 00:23:33.855
Next Those Who Hunt Elves:

00:23:33.879 --> 00:23:36.557
"The Addition of the Fifth Ally"!

00:23:36.581 --> 00:23:38.640
Please watch for the next episode.
